o the affected stories. Add a 'business rules confirmed' line to UAT sign-off=
 covering returns, refunds, loyalty points and pricing. Open business-rule qu=
estions already exist on MT-978 (loyalty points) and MT-1488 (refund and exch=
ange timelines).
